---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { getAllContentData } from '../../server/lib/contentData.js';
const menuData = await getAllContentData('en');
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy" menuData={menuData} lang="en">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose prose-neutral">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US')}</p>
    <p>This Privacy Policy explains how Capital M Intellectual Property S.A.S. ("Capital M", "we") collects, uses, and protects your personal data in Colombia, in accordance with Law 1581 of 2012, Decree 1377 of 2013, and guidance from the Superintendence of Industry and Commerce (SIC).</p>

    <h2>Data Controller</h2>
    <p>Capital M Intellectual Property S.A.S., Medellín, Colombia. Contact: <a href="mailto:info@capitaleme.com">info@capitaleme.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>Personal Data We Process</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Identification and contact data: name, email, phone, ID (when applicable).</li>
      <li>Message content and files you voluntarily attach via forms.</li>
      <li>Technical/usage data (cookies, analytics) to improve the website.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Purposes</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Respond to your inquiries and manage professional services.</li>
      <li>Contracting, billing, compliance with legal obligations.</li>
      <li>Security, fraud prevention, and service improvement.</li>
      <li>Service-related communications. No spam or mass marketing without consent.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Lawful Basis</h2>
    <p>Authorization by the data subject, performance of a contract, and compliance with legal obligations under Colombian law.</p>

    <h2>Data Sharing</h2>
    <p>We may share data with processors (e.g., hosting, email providers) bound by confidentiality and data processing agreements. International transfers will follow adequate safeguards.</p>

    <h2>Data Retention</h2>
    <p>We retain data for the time necessary to fulfill the purposes or as required by law and professional duties.</p>

    <h2>Data Subject Rights (ARCO)</h2>
    <p>You may request access, rectification, update, deletion, and revocation of authorization. Contact: <a href="mailto:info@capitaleme.com">info@capitaleme.com</a>. We will respond within legal deadlines.</p>

    <h2>Security</h2>
    <p>We implement technical and organizational measures to protect your data; however, no method is 100% secure. We will address incidents according to applicable law.</p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>We use cookies to improve your experience. You can manage preferences in your browser. See also our cookie notices where applicable.</p>

    <h2>Updates</h2>
    <p>We may update this Policy. The current version will be published here with its effective date.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>

